    "editorid": "damsel0_VeilNote",
    "path": "BookText",
    "text": "<font face='$HandwrittenFont'><font size='18'>\r\nI've told you repeatedly to hand that vampire wench back over. Stop using the excuse that she's \"For Research\". I know what you do to that thing. Everybody staying in the nearby rooms can hear what you do to her. She's too dangerous, and if you don't stop I'll put both of you up for target practice with the rest of the specimens.\r\n\r\n- The Caller\r\n</font>\r\n\r\n",
    "parent_context": {}
